# Reference-Driven Design Decisions

DEC-style records for decisions made through reference comparison
(RIE engine, references/engine.sdd). Conflicts between references
route here with the Reference Matrix attached.

Entry format:
  <decision>
    decision: TAKE | ADAPT | REJECT | IGNORE
    pattern: @pattern.<name>
    reason: evidence bullets
    source: REF-<n>

State: +
